      "fallback_used": false,
      "fallback_attempts": [],
      "attempt_count": 1,
      "asr_text": "You call me mad? No, nervous, perhaps, but perfectly sane. My illness sharpened my senses, especially my hearing. I hear everything in heaven and earth. Listen to my calm voice and judge for yourself. I loved the old man who shared my home. He had never hurt me. I wanted none of his money. But his eye, pale blue, covered by a cloudy film, a vulture's eye, whenever it turned towards me, my blood went cold. I had to be free of it.",
